# Log-triage — hilog mixed ArkTS↔Cangjie crossover crash
#
# Exercises PR-A mixed-language detection: ArkTS UI calls Cangjie
# native via @CJOH FFI; Cangjie panic propagates back to ArkTS
# rejecting the call. Both .ets and .cj frames appear in one log.
# The log_triager should emit two stack snapshots OR a single chain
# whose Cause pointer crosses language boundaries.
#
# Ground truth: synthetic; tests log_triage's ability to classify
# mixed-language logs without losing either frame set.
ID="hilog_mixed_arkts_cangjie"
NAME="log-triage hilog mixed ArkTS+Cangjie crossover"
QUESTION="这个混合栈崩溃涉及 ArkTS 和仓颉两种语言，分别在哪一帧出问题？"
LOG='04-15 14:40:01.512 6201 6201 E A0c0d/JsApp: Error: Cangjie native call failed: index out of bounds
04-15 14:40:01.512 6201 6201 E A0c0d/JsApp:     at NativeBridge.invokeOhSum (entry/src/main/ets/bridges/NativeBridge.ets:33:11)
04-15 14:40:01.512 6201 6201 E A0c0d/JsApp:     at HomePage.computeTotal (entry/src/main/ets/pages/Home.ets:54:7)
04-15 14:40:01.513 6201 6201 F A0c0d/CjApp: panic: index out of bounds: index=5, size=3
04-15 14:40:01.513 6201 6201 F A0c0d/CjApp:     at demo.bridge.ohSum(src/bridge/Bridge.cj:18)
04-15 14:40:01.513 6201 6201 F A0c0d/CjApp:     at demo.bridge.checkout(src/bridge/Bridge.cj:42)
'
EXPECT_CONTAINS="index out of bounds"
EXPECT_SECTIONS="Bridge"
